<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page qd-theme qd-home"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="heading">打开轻动展示位链接</view><view class="notice section">目标网页需允许在小程序中打开。无法打开时，可复制链接自行查看。</view><view class="card section"><text selectable>{{url}}</text><button class="btn mt" disabled="{{!valid}}" bindtap="open">打开网页</button><button class="btn soft mt" bindtap="copy">复制链接</button></view><web-view wx:if="{{opened && valid}}" src="{{url}}" binderror="failed"/></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
